  "notes": "PLN dropped (no raw vendor source). CORN 2021-12 annual-roll has a minor self-reversing blip (thin new-crop overlap). | 2026-09: +7 Barchart breadth (BUXL,DAX,DX,SUGAR11,V2X,SPI200,RUBBER) via core-api fetch; universe 80->87. | 2026-09: 7 migrated DB->BC (BRE,PLAT,GASOILINE,HEATOIL,RICE,SILVER-mini,PALLAD) via patched bc-utils core-api; full 2014-2026 history. | 2026-09: +9 FX crosses (AUDJPY,CADJPY,CHFJPY,EURAUD,EURCHF,GBPEUR,YENEUR,PLN,CZK) via core-api; 87->96. | dropped stalled thin crosses ['AUDJPY', 'CHFJPY', 'EURAUD'] (roll won't complete); kept 6 usable FX crosses. 96->93. | cutoff 2025-12-31->2026-06-30; EURCAD DB->BC; seed extended to Jun-2026 (BC live + DB to Aug). | 2026-09: +29 rate/energy/metal candidates for evaluation (research branch). | dropped 12 stalled/errored candidates (thin-contract roll fail): ['COPPER_LME', 'LEAD_LME', 'NICKEL_LME', 'TIN_LME', 'BB3M', 'CAD10', 'CAD2', 'HIGHYIELD', 'BRENT', 'COAL', 'GAS_NL', 'SOFR']. Kept 17 usable. | vol-floor screen: dropped 7 sub-5% rates ['CH10', 'JGB-SGX-mini', 'JGB', 'CAD5', 'SONIA3', 'FED', 'EURIBOR-ICE']. Kept 10 candidates (9 energy/metal/equity + IRS). | dropped ['IRS', 'GAS_UK', 'CRUDE_ICE']: IRS decimal-price sizing bomb (mislabeled shekel), GAS_UK $2.3M notional untradeable @500K, CRUDE_ICE negative prices. Kept 7 clean candidates. | dropped ALUMINIUM: 2018 flat/stale patch (251/252 days flat) -> vol->0 -> trillion-contract sizing blowup. Kept 6 clean candidates. | re-added 7 (ALUMINIUM,COPPER_LME,LEAD_LME,NICKEL_LME,TIN_LME,BRENT,COAL) with start_year_override=2020 (skip illiquid early contracts; recent data clean/liquid). | re-DROPPED 7: Barchart core-api returned BLOB contracts (median 1000-3400d span, not individual expiries) -> roll uncomputable. Was mis-diagnosed as early-illiquidity; actually bad per-contract data. Back to clean 99. | HIGHYIELD (Cboe iBoxx HY credit, CFE) re-added with start_year_override=2022 (pre-2022 blobbed; clean post-2022). HY credit = unique factor vs IG. | removed HIGHYIELD: untradeable @500K (1 contract=36.7% of capital vs 2.5% target -> holds 0) AND redundant (0.7 corr to held US-cyclical equity + IG). Back to 99. | HIGHYIELD re-included: optimiser assigns it weight (wants risk in HY direction); trust dyn-opt to size it. Not selected on backtest SR. | STIRs ['SOFR', 'SONIA3', 'EURIBOR', 'FED'] re-added to TEST: capital math shows tradeable @500K (IDM+sizer compensate ~1% vol). Empirical test vs 5%-floor heuristic exclusion."
